    {
      "target": "도쿄(동경) 지하철은 참 복잡해요.",
      "reading": "dokyo(donggyeong) jihacheoreun cham bokjaphaeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "The Tokyo subway is really crowded.",
        "ko": "도쿄(동경) 지하철은 참 복잡해요.",
        "ipa": "dokyo(donggyeong) jihacheoreun cham bokjaphaeyo.",
        "ar": "مترو طوكيو مزدحم جدًا.",
